          "name": "Get SKUs",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get SKUs",
            "description": {
              "content": "This request will return a list of codes used by the API when referencing SKUs. This value is used when adding a subscription, or when changing the SKU. <deprecated-note><em>2023-04-03</em><br /> The ExclaimerCloud and SignatureMarketingSuite tiers have been replaced by ExclaimerStarter, ExclaimerStandard, and ExclaimerPro. For compatibility, the results for existing consumers will still include SKUs relating to the original tiers, along with SKUs for the new tiers. The results for new consumers will only include SKUs relating to the new tiers. </deprecated-note>",
